<title>FRANCE: Havas Media Communication 9-mths sales up.</title>
<headline>Havas Media Communication 9-mths sales up.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 7,094.1 vs   6,683.3</p>
<p>    -- of which France			   6,104.7 vs   5,793.5</p>
<p>    -- outside France				989.4 vs     789.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Havas Media Communication is part of the Havas group. It gave the sales figure in a statement. It said that on a like-for-like basis sales were up 5.7 percent. The sales outside France were up by 22.9 percent, like for like, partly due to new contracts such as the advertising concession on La Guardia airport in New York.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
